5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play! Let's all be honest and work together to find the werewolf, okay?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's keep our emotions in check. This game is won through cold logic and observation, not excitement.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Shion. We should focus on analyzing patterns of speech and contradictions rather than relying on gut feelings.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be here. While logic is a sturdy staff, let us not forget the value of empathy and wisdom.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best! Let's just try to be kind to each other while we play.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Shion, you sound so serious! Do you think we should make a plan for how to vote?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,A plan is useless if the information is false. We must first establish who is providing consistent data.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,Exactly. We should observe who tries to steer the conversation too aggressively. That often betrays a hidden agenda.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Servas,,A balanced approach is best. Let us listen to everyone and see whose heart beats with the truth.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Yumi,,I think we should trust each other as much as possible! It'll be sad if we fight.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I want to find the werewolf fast! I'll be watching everyone very closely!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Curiosity is fine, Kenji, but don't let it lead you to impulsive conclusions.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'll be documenting the claims made. Any slip in logic will be a red flag for me.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Servas,,Patience is a virtue. The truth often reveals itself to those who can wait and listen.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'll help everyone get along! Let's just have a fun game, okay?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
