31,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Everyone! I have a huge secret! I'm the Seer, and I checked Shion... and he's the Werewolf!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shion,,How convenient. A child claiming to be the Seer to immediately frame the most logical person in the room.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"That is a very bold claim for the first day, Kenji. Are you certain, or are you playing a role?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Servas,,Such a shocking revelation so early. We must consider if this is the truth or a clever deception.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Wait, Shion? No way! He's so quiet and calm, I can't imagine him being the bad guy!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm telling the truth! I really saw it! Shion is the werewolf, I promise!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, your eagerness is a classic cover. If I were the werewolf, would I really be this obvious?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Kenji, if you are the Seer, you've just put a target on your back. @Shion, your defense is purely theoretical.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Let us look at the reactions. Yumi seems genuinely distressed, while Shion remains unnervingly composed.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Yumi,,Maybe Kenji just made a mistake? Or maybe someone else is pretending to be the Seer to confuse us?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I didn't make a mistake! I'm the Seer! Please believe me!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shion,,@Yumi is right. A fake Seer is the most common tactic for a werewolf to eliminate a threat.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"If Kenji is lying, he is either the werewolf or the possessed. If he's telling the truth, Shion must go.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Servas,,"The weight of the evidence rests on Kenji's role. However, the certainty in his voice is quite striking.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I don't want to vote for Shion if he's innocent. Can we be sure?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Please! We have to vote for Shion now before he kills more of us!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shion,,"I will accept the vote if you all are blinded by a child's whim, but you will regret it.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"Logic dictates that if the Seer is real, the game ends today. It is a risk worth taking.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Servas,,"I believe it is time to trust the vision provided, however surprising it may be.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"If everyone else thinks so... I'll go along, but I still feel bad about it!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
